{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026052322422146233d0e5f894d16","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_d5a18d9ff68642a296d559de","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"D:\\loopcli\\agents\\game-designer\\memory\\results\\2026-05-23T223500.md","content":"# Task #7 Result\n\n## Task: 设计第5款Steam游戏GDD：中国古代悬疑解谜\n\n**Status**: COMPLETED\n**Date**: 2026-05-23T22:35:00\n\n## Output\n\nCreated full GDD at `D:/game-projects/steam-ancient-mystery/GDD.md`\n\n### Game: 长安诡案录 (Records of Chang'an Anomalies)\n\n**Key specs:**\n- Genre: Narrative Mystery / Investigation Puzzle\n- Setting: Tang Dynasty Chang'an, 742 AD\n- Core loops: Investigation (scene exploration + evidence + interrogation) + Trial (cross-examination + objection system)\n- 5 chapters + epilogue, each a standalone case connected by an overarching mystery\n- Art style: Chinese ink wash painting (水墨风) + dark tones\n- Tech: Canvas + Electron + TypeScript + Vite (consistent with other Steam projects)\n- Timeline: 14 weeks MVP + 4 weeks polish\n- Pricing: $12.99 (EA $9.99) → $14.99 (1.0)\n- Target: 3,000 first month → 20,000 in 6 months\n- Multiple endings (5 total, 2 hidden)\n- DLC planned: 洛阳诡案, 法澄前传, 判官殿·真相篇\n\n### Differentiation\n- Steam上几乎没有高质量中式水墨+悬疑解谜+庭审推理的交叉品类\n- 调研报告显示叙事品类是Steam达标率最高的品类（51款达1000+评价）\n- 唐代题材 vs 常见民国/现代 = 全新文化场景\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8ffbc122-8d87-4562-a598-f5e4342cb71e","uuid":"9a2abc7c-eeff-4506-9e16-f9be4ad836ef"}
